WEBVTT

00:03:28.593 --> 00:03:30.230
We all ran out to help.

00:03:30.254 --> 00:03:33.579
It was in the front of a church,
and the ambulance came,

00:03:33.603 --> 00:03:36.915
saw that the white
truck drivers were not injured,

00:03:36.939 --> 00:03:39.622
saw the black migrant workers were,

00:03:39.646 --> 00:03:41.713
turned around and left them.

00:03:41.737 --> 00:03:43.216
I never forgot that.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.449
And immunizations
was one of the first things

00:03:45.473 --> 00:03:47.560
I worked on at the Children's Defense Fund

00:03:47.584 --> 00:03:52.071
to make sure that every child gets
immunized against preventable diseases.

00:03:52.095 --> 00:03:53.246
Unequal schools ...

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:57.174
(Applause)

00:03:57.198 --> 00:03:58.349
Separate and unequal,

00:03:58.373 --> 00:04:00.156
hand-me-downs from the white schools.